{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4df7be7da4d1ca08","name":"Galactic Alliance Covert Agent","source":{"id":"source:reference-4df7be7da4d1ca08","title":"Galactic Alliance Covert Agent","revision":20165,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:20:15Z","sha256":"b36b70370084ff4c3e745c945ead869e39ed52bc9f7802525ca11e7377d638ad","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20165","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Galactic%20Alliance%20Covert%20Agent&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4df7be7da4d1ca08","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Galactic Alliance Core Fleet Covert Agents are scattered across the galaxy. Though the network is not large, many agents are stationed in prime positions to provide Admiral ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gar Stazi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gar_Stazi","referenceId":"reference:829f1014aee4c71a"}," and the fleet with the data they need to fight ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," and, more importantly, raid for supplies. Thanks to the manner in which the Galactic Alliance bureaucracy is incorporated wholesale into the Imperial governing structure, recruiting new or double agents in positions of power is easier than in past conflicts.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When the Galactic Alliance Core Fleet makes contact with someone already sympathetic to their cause against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empir